XCOMM Imakefile for x2089, the Xlib frontend of 2089: the X way to build it,
XCOMM with the X installation's own compiler, flags and libraries.
XCOMM
XCOMM     xmkmf
XCOMM     make
XCOMM
XCOMM (On AIX, imake's rules call the compiler cc_r: have /usr/vac/bin on
XCOMM PATH.)  The shared sources are linked in from the directories above,
XCOMM as imake does for sources kept elsewhere.
XCOMM
XCOMM Author: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), October 2026.
XCOMM MIT License; see LICENSE.

        DEPLIBS = $(DEPXLIB)
LOCAL_LIBRARIES = $(XLIB)
       INCLUDES = -I. -I.. -I../..
           SRCS = x11.c xboard.c common.c 2089.c rng89.c
           OBJS = x11.o xboard.o common.o 2089.o rng89.o

AllTarget(x2089)

LinkSourceFile(common.c,..)
LinkSourceFile(2089.c,../..)
LinkSourceFile(rng89.c,../..)

NormalProgramTarget(x2089,$(OBJS),$(DEPLIBS),$(LOCAL_LIBRARIES),NullParameter)
InstallProgram(x2089,$(BINDIR))
DependTarget()
